- tr-a 1’s suggested link text drops digit 10. The Korean source still has 제10조 on that line. The public label now says the treaty 10% ceiling is not the text of this link.
- tr-a 22’s suggested sentence drops "ileri konular 2" and the gloss (公司設立). This file is 심화편-2. Only the glossary stub was removed.
- tr-a 4 is not a claim that "TWD 1.57M" reads as Turkish. The bio figure is pinned, so it was not rewritten.
- tr-a 20, tr-a 24, and tr-b 11 correctly describe the U+200B lines and the Hangul slugs. Deleting the zero-width spaces, promoting Q16–Q20 to headings, or editing `url` fails the checker or R16.
